    headline: "GaN charger not charging laptop full speed: why wattage drops.",
    description: "A GaN charger delivering less power than advertised is almost always negotiating a lower USB-PD profile due to multi-port sharing, cable rating, port compatibility, or thermal throttle — not a broken charger. Diagnose the power path before replacing the brick.",
